			"$comment": "Since 2.0.0: the card, text, muted and line colours, a typeface of the device (its space is query-encoded; `+` or `%20`, the comparison is on decoded pairs), and the basket's two parts on their own. The app keeps its own cart bar and hides the chat's summary bar."
